    <node id="&quot;ATENÇÃO BÁSICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">Here is the comprehensive summary:

**Atenção Básica (AB)**

Atenção Básica (AB) is a fundamental healthcare approach that prioritizes comprehensive primary care in Brazil. It focuses on prevention, early intervention, and holistic patient-centered treatment to address various health issues, including common mental disorders, eating disorders, obesity, and other health concerns. AB provides basic medical and social services, particularly for older adults, and plays an essential role in preventing diseases like obesity and promoting overall well-being.

As a primary healthcare system in Brazil, Atenção Básica refers to the first level of contact between healthcare providers and patients, focusing on primary care and prevention. It encompasses primary healthcare services provided by professionals, including those addressing common mental disorders and other health issues. AB also serves as a basic healthcare unit that provides primary care services and is responsible for treating obesity through non-surgical means.

AB is an organization that occupies a privileged position in controlling tobacco within the Unified Health System (SUS) and aligns with Saúde Mental in addressing the needs and well-being of individuals. The Department of Basic Care is a unit within the Ministry of Health focused on primary health care services, emphasizing preventive care and early detection of diseases.

In summary, Atenção Básica (AB) is an integral part of the Brazilian healthcare system, prioritizing comprehensive primary care, prevention, early intervention, and holistic patient-centered treatment to address various health issues. It provides basic care services, particularly for older adults, children, and families in Brazil, focusing on prevention and health promotion.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7767247adb9d535867ff496267555d7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2de9053de8187dce645b9c67245f39a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37a446b38db5416fdf2ace97c1f6f6bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0600cc19752de29a3d163c3985c328&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea28a3cebe89c218471e4ce120eea4f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e68f7c2a7af56f8cf13672a22068c5ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac458c03306ff3eb666b270f65369dcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-981422ef7d9d7de8dfc81ebc47669920&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ac760738de5edfa897c3ca5b1c864d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc88ee6dfa63a03b874da042bb4efdf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3dcf6b9833ac7d158cf5fe2b0508cfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b4f5a2b8a2da5e43c67a7f680967cf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-116f7a66a5dc450d006735bf96712b93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2719c5ac33e4d4354d6e811f32b4f68c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-996db457bad6e7d03a13324428ef24c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72c0982ce32e4738bb1a2f466150a02d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31bd5ccda3e6ccc6ca5b869c57dcf90d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61a895fe92a5f203b2082d7261f258a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cbf7a3bca632d2eb9c94ede11a1edb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3d63b984d7ef24a825f148c80f4b715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb5cdbba4e7206968c98a9bcdf3b9827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6982cf132ff2405a71b0bfc86a6d2d62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed39b1758c2946fd59fc56fd94f89dde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5b500e7e472d02eb449ad5ba8082be5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85e8ad65c67bb39be48c8c6c73b0a25f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-617eb62a4d15af0f5011e8a0d2c1b475&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4683ecbc1498796ebb1f990e7ff6b554&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20b4d06c6548081ee298fc00ee33dae5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1b255d655fa0c39742796999b2aa106&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8cc5a0b5e3e1204647fe73c431487f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a44aa1a3fcb2e63cef48ccb0a0743b59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1bbb6a492cb315132942a31ceb21956&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d048ecbcc33202cc6fa6605ee3b3133a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb3eab63e277848273beaa2f384a54c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a94e02125db89dc93c89fac340f1422&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba87da61558bdc9d77d6e9ffe160c3d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8eb5c0551aace7394cd17a0bc65f456&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c363e6cb6655d7d1fc224f961ad27950&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed7a24bca3e040d50fc3452d7f959660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4177e4f989eb16a1416b5d09d724b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d735bb6849bc0