      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A UBS (Unidade Básica de Saúde) é um serviço que oferece atendimento básico à saúde das pessoas, incluindo a saúde mental."&lt;SEP&gt;"Basic Health Units"&lt;SEP&gt;"The UBS (Unidade Básica de Saúde) nearby provides healthcare services to F.F.S.'s family."&lt;SEP&gt;"The UBS is a location where Lucimara frequently visits with various complaints."&lt;SEP&gt;"The same as the unidade de Saúde, providing basic health care services."&lt;SEP&gt;"UBS (Unidade Básica de Saúde) is a basic healthcare unit that provides primary care services, including those related to excess weight or obesity."&lt;SEP&gt;"UBS (Unidade Básica de Saúde) is a basic healthcare unit."&lt;SEP&gt;"UBS refers to the Unidade Básica de Saúde, or basic health unit in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"UBS refers to Unidades Básicas de Saúde, which are basic healthcare units in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"Unidade Básica de Saúde."&lt;SEP&gt;"UBS stands for Unidade Básica de Saúde, which is a primary healthcare unit providing basic medical services."&lt;SEP&gt;"UBS (Unidade de Saúde) is a health unit that collaborates with the Fundação, SMAS, and SMEL to provide services to families in need."&lt;SEP&gt;"UBS refers to a specific organization involved in the story, possibly a social service provider or healthcare institution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The UBS refers to the basic health care unit."&lt;SEP&gt;The UBS is an organization related to basic health care units.|"&lt;/entity&gt;"&lt;SEP&gt;"A UBS is a basic healthcare unit providing primary care services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The UBS is a location where Amélia meets with the Médico."&lt;SEP&gt;"The UBS is the location where Amélia has an individual consultation with her doctor."&lt;SEP&gt;"UBS (Unidade Básica de Saúde) is an organization that provides health services and aims to promote health among people with chronic conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"UBS refers to the Unified Health System, which Amélia visits for her health issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"The UBS is an organization that provides basic attention to people, including dental procedures."</data>
