Sam Rivera is a member of Alex's team, working on health-related matters and providing services to the "casa dos 20" community. They are a person who shows a mix of awe and anxiety about communicating with an unknown intelligence, demonstrating youthful energy and professionalism in their work.

As a team member, Sam is involved in using the VEMTA method to calculate the reduction in caloric intake needed for weight loss, indicating expertise in health services. They also make comments about intelligence and communication, suggesting experience in research and communication with unknown entities.

Sam's role within the team is unclear, but they are mentioned as having a mix of awe and anxiety regarding the implications of communicating with an unknown intelligence. They may be involved in writing reports on tobacco use and cessation in psychiatric disorders or working on other health-related projects.

It appears that Sam Rivera has expertise in both health services and research, and their team is focused on providing services to underserved communities. Their involvement in communicating with unknown entities suggests a unique skillset and perspective within the field of health communications.&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Rivera is a member of a team involved in communicating with an unknown intelligence."&lt;SEP&gt;"A person who works with the team to communicate with an unknown intelligence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Member of a team working on communicating with an unknown intelligence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sam Rivera is a member of a team working on communicating with an unknown intelligence."</data>
