    <node id="&quot;SAÚDE DA FAMÍLIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A program that provides comprehensive healthcare to families."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família (SF) provides comprehensive care to families, including health education and promotion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família is an organization that provides family-centered health services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família refers to a healthcare program that focuses on providing services to families in their homes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família refers to a healthcare program that provides services to families in their homes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família refers to family healthcare services and support."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família is an organization that provides primary healthcare services to families in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família refers to the health care provided to families."&lt;SEP&gt;"A strategy for expanding and consolidating basic healthcare attention, focusing on family health."&lt;SEP&gt;"A strategy for expanding and consolidating basic healthcare attention."&lt;SEP&gt;"Family Health is a concept related to health care provided by family physicians in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"Health of the Family is a concept that emphasizes the importance of family health in the overall well-being of individuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família is an organization that provides healthcare services to families."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família refers to family-centered healthcare and care for families."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família is a concept that emphasizes the importance of family-centered care and community-based health services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família is a healthcare program that coordinates and integrates health services in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família is a healthcare program that provides integrated care to families and communities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família refers to the comprehensive care provided to families through the Sistema Único de Saúde (SUS)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Strategy of Family Health works closely with the Program of Screening to improve health outcomes."&lt;SEP&gt;"A saúde da família é um conjunto de serviços que visam atender às necessidades de saúde dos indivíduos e suas famílias."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família is a healthcare program that focuses on family-centered care and prevention of illnesses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família is an organization that provides health care services, especially in the context of the Atenção Básica program."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Família is an organization that works with interdisciplinary practices and teams responsible for community health."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Saúde da Família is a family health program in Brazil."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8b5b2715ce4b631867f9c8ba022e12a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af2903b5966a2d1a0c94cb64ab99f6f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9ea7d25ebc3ea73887d6ceaa4d9e53e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7d6c74c6ad6c8c14d1280f63f1cf5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0b66f26ed8ddb20c5c67af47704b457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-981422ef7d9d7de8dfc81ebc47669920&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc88ee6dfa63a03b874da042bb4efdf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-215970c8788330467e055b822a5be40e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5574bd725f5d535a34bcb83df8b5f62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d624f5e6673ab8f17b1b5fc7a215ff5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61a895fe92a5f203b2082d7261f258a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4863ef942e171a5d3e79f0b2505ec705&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed39b1758c2946fd59fc56fd94f89dde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fafb8b2529819deb56ac5f391b3309b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fb9ea51ef9fe3474e11a9e9f37128fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d4229fd3bd102d19b0eda5f25ce65a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52723b3e9872218fc830c3d110cfa8ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1bbb6a492cb315132942a31ceb21956&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9d37c5fcad363fc9696a4f8137decd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-483efc8a7d3c5dc5d248da4b6a44e81e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed7a24bca3e040d50fc3452d7f959660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2248d2bf48adea76bc2f43dcc5ff48ab</data>
