    <node id="&quot;IMC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A measure of body mass index used to assess weight status in children and adolescents"&lt;SEP&gt;"Body mass index (IMC) is an important measure of a child's health and weight status."&lt;SEP&gt;"IMC (Índice de Massa Corporal) is a measure of body mass index."&lt;SEP&gt;"IMC stands for Body Mass Index, a measure used to determine if an individual is underweight, normal weight, overweight, or obese."&lt;SEP&gt;"IMC stands for Indice de Massa Corporal, a measurement used to classify body mass index."&lt;SEP&gt;"IMC stands for Indice de Massa Corporal, or body mass index."&lt;SEP&gt;"IMC stands for Índice de Massa Corporal, which is a measure of body mass index."&lt;SEP&gt;"IMC stands for Índice de Massa Corpórea, which is the Body Mass Index (BMI) used to classify individuals as underweight, normal weight, overweight, or obese based on their height and weight."&lt;SEP&gt;"Body Mass Index (BMI) is a crucial metric in assessing overall health and wellness."&lt;SEP&gt;"IMC refers to a measure of body mass index."&lt;SEP&gt;"The ratio of a person's weight in kilograms to the square of their height in meters."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3c9553fea0c26fa616b3f551ecd676c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca72c5e0d930500572c28667296eb0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f246af066137086d88f024d2f4529e2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61a895fe92a5f203b2082d7261f258a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72425852cd3b261f8159a651be7bb1cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f23d50ba2da652e4afeb3873845fcc4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb3eab63e277848273beaa2f384a54c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a9738505c5e6c2235df2341fc850cc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6307a564225680f13fe9bc0dd32a23c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74ff96a3df74d5e52c955b28713b02e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4cef3c09404097d781dc4d636b641c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53ed59f6b0e98e93fb5837fe2400963</data>
    </node>
