    <node id="&quot;HIPERTENSÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A hipertensão é a condição de pressão arterial elevada que pode causar danos ao organismo."&lt;SEP&gt;"A hipertensão é uma doença que pode ser protegida pela amamentação materna."&lt;SEP&gt;"High blood pressure, a complication of excess weight or obesity in children and adolescents"&lt;SEP&gt;"Hipertensão is a medical condition where blood pressure is consistently high, often requiring monitoring and management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hypertension is a condition characterized by high blood pressure, which can lead to kidney damage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hipertensão refers to hypertension as a health condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hipertensão refers to hypertension or high blood pressure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hipertensão is a medical condition related to high blood pressure which can be caused by excessive salt consumption."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hipertensão is another example of a doença crônica that affects the usuário's health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hypertension is a condition that can be prevented or reduced through exclusive and predominant breastfeeding."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hypertension is a prevalent condition contributing to various negative health outcomes, including premature mortality, heart attacks, kidney failure, and stroke."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hipertensão é uma condição de saúde que pode estar associada à diabetes e aumentar o risco de desenvolver complicações." |</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4a9738505c5e6c2235df2341fc850cc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b5e275006cd71a7686e3fb3c19ad7de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acf6e4a3740ae64bcd35725e2319de1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b72a96b809dcaa337bb1412768e921a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-483efc8a7d3c5dc5d248da4b6a44e81e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9549fba40f37a05c2fb74d78e4147573&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4cef3c09404097d781dc4d636b641c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07f02fc6fcf3797e88f1d1bd01a1a995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0e379ffac0b7ea70d5a2d80f108a217&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92ec024756de968e8a8c35f79637b6b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-693ad4363a42339f8ae77226663499b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5be53d0e30810ab5c32f2921b9ad9b0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIABETES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DISEASE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A diabetes é uma doença metabólica caracterizada pela hiperglicemia crônica."&lt;SEP&gt;"A medical condition characterized by high blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes is a chronic medical condition affecting insulin production or usage, requiring ongoing care and management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes is a chronic metabolic disorder characterized by high blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes is a condition mentioned throughout the text, referring to various types including DM tipo 1 and DM tipo 2."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes is a metabolic disorder characterized by high blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"DIABETES is a medical condition that can affect the management of hypertension treatment, indicating its relevance to overall health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes refers to diabetes mellitus as a health condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes refers to a metabolic disorder affecting blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes is an example of a doença crônica that affects the usuário's health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes is mentioned as one of the chronic conditions affected by substance use."&lt;SEP&gt;"Type II diabetes is a condition leading to increased risk of cardiovascular events, kidney failure, and other negative health outcomes if left unmanaged."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes is a condition affecting blood glucose levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes is a metabolic disorder characterized by high blood glucose levels, which can lead to complications such as hypoglycemia."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes is a metabolic disorder that affects blood sugar levels."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5b5e275006cd71a7686e3fb3c19ad7de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a9738505c5e6c2235df2341fc850cc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acf6e4a3740ae64bcd35725e2319de1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-483efc8a7d3c5dc5d248da4b6a44e81e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6089f444c066d0375f061601da224f54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-030149fe8b0c41035be20549586d629b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07f02fc6fcf3797e88f1d1bd01a1a995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2aec6be4c7bee1e546e8178355b886b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6d06a5132611f9acdf1b2708a6502ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81bd11c17e0a52109484ebab619de92f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87c341ea69f31b94b6ce3a8697ccceb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e214a761cbb1193242c87168fe80c31b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a040fa037220ae7a638ca6c2227b1820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5be53d0e30810ab5c32f2921b9ad9b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8329b5264a11203795c34d3c6a9c942</data>
