    <node id="&quot;CRIANÇAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Children are individuals under the age of 10, with different nutritional needs and guidelines based on age."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indivíduos ou grupos de indivíduos em fase de desenvolvimento físico e mental."&lt;SEP&gt;"Children"&lt;SEP&gt;"Crianças refers to children who are being treated with neurolépticos, requiring special consideration due to their faster metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"The children are a group of individuals who experience emotional distress due to their father's absence and lack of visitation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Children with jaw, nose, and mouth deformities"&lt;SEP&gt;"Crianças refers to children, emphasizing the importance of proper nutrition and care for their development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crianças refers to children, which have unique needs and challenges related to breastfeeding."&lt;SEP&gt;"children"&lt;SEP&gt;"Crianças refers to children and adolescents who require special care and attention in primary healthcare services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crianças refers to children, who are the focus of public health policies and interventions aimed at preventing and addressing specific health concerns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crianças se referem a indivíduos menores de 15 anos."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a9b26c4fe648881d25316a99ab1ef832&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d23a9545abd00d9b50e74268827a0d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6611ecebcb218b105d5f5e56abd40fe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70747c6226a7ed8607787fee4d79d813&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a33065f55d89ec89d49b9d01be8ba4a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-398f2c52a92e58c8bbe6f686b5989879&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1949f890dcf71789af5a2958cae81f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa501b055e52df2a4ea18b5c039faf9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-800753abf4eb15becd47a86a099bf9a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9f02322094ac9d526bb0e64762f9904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5bbccd98df66b7fa1ac3309106ff6b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71fda5caa1eced9b38b058b32ad775c5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOBREPESO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT/CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Excess weight or obesity, as indicated by IMC."&lt;SEP&gt;"Overweight is a concept related to excess body fat and weight gain."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sobrepeso (excess weight) is a condition characterized by an excess of body fat, often accompanied by related health issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sobrepeso is the condition of being overweight, characterized by excess body fat."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sobrepeso refers to a condition where a gestante has excess weight, typically above 25 kg/m²."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sobrepeso refers to a condition where an individual's weight is above the normal range, indicating overweight or obesity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sobrepeso refers to overweight or excess weight."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sobrepeso refers to a condition of excess weight, but not obesity, corresponding to an IMC between 25-29.9."&lt;SEP&gt;"Overweight is another event or condition related to obesity, highlighting the need for early intervention and prevention."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sobrepeso é um problema de saúde que pode aumentar o risco de desenvolver complicações da diabetes." |</data>
