    <node id="&quot;ALEITAMENTO MATERNO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aleitamento Materno refers to breastfeeding as a healthy practice for mothers and babies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aleitamento materno refers to breastfeeding, which is recommended for exclusive use until 6 months and complementary up to 2 years."&lt;SEP&gt;"Breastfeeding, a method of providing milk to infants that has its own set of guidelines and recommendations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Exclusive breastfeeding refers to feeding a baby only breast milk until six months old."&lt;SEP&gt;"The act of providing breast milk to a child."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aleitamento materno is associated with a reduced risk of breast cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aleitamento Materno refers to breastfeeding as a method of feeding infants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aleitamento Materno refers to breastfeeding, which has various benefits including the prevention of infant mortality and allergies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aleitamento Materno refers to breastfeeding, which is recommended as the best method of nutrition for infants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aleitamento Materno refers to breastfeeding, which is the most natural way to feed a baby."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aleitamento Materno refers to breastfeeding, which prevails diseases that demand intensified care;"&lt;SEP&gt;"Aleitamento Materno refers to breastfeeding."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aleitamento Materno refers to the practice of breastfeeding, which has been proven to be superior to other milk options."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aleitamento materno refers to breastfeeding, which is the best option for childcare."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aleitamento materno é o processo natural pelo qual as mães nutrem seus filhos com leite materno."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aleitamento materno é um processo pelo qual a mãe fornece leite para a criança."&lt;SEP&gt;"Breastfeeding is a natural process that provides the baby with essential nutrients and promotes a strong bond between mother and child."&lt;SEP&gt;"Breastfeeding is an event with various benefits for the child, including reduced risk of obesity and improved cognitive development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Breastfeeding"&lt;SEP&gt;"O aleitamento materno é essencial para a nutrição da criança e deve ser mantido por um período adequado."&lt;SEP&gt;"O aleitamento materno é um processo que é promovido como importante para o bem-estar da mãe e do filho."&lt;SEP&gt;"O aleitamento materno é uma prática que beneficia a saúde da mãe e da criança."&lt;SEP&gt;"aleitamento materno is a topic or event related to breastfeeding."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ea28a3cebe89c218471e4ce120eea4f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec5d6db3e6ddb7fa8af08cba050b7bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e5ebe64151a8e84f5d0afb2d388a538&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2e50ce0ef2209f162e71fe528b8e528&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8690e61874bde6ade83405a22c8b1259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c8abf3f43a4272056acc25a786a9557&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78b49b43774b87fac5b807072941eddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-181a5e5a2171314ab86dd34b54870723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6307a564225680f13fe9bc0dd32a23c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7470f38ecc446988dbf9344f1c0157b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a57ab9b4d74fad769a77a4833169c82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d23a9545abd00d9b50e74268827a0d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4e6aa96ca9aac36657d22aaf2a4d133&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4e91780229d083ec9f3787f1585ad05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-907da0e23b871deecabf6c3bc0d4866e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61687e370a0915e797b3eedd615aac2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9549fba40f37a05c2fb74d78e4147573&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-693ad4363a42339f8ae77226663499b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0b6a5ed47abd1a1a181ad13a19e6ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb27b0d0f843229c4362efd22629b3e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc3848820131245accf65741c70096e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5a68c912ec8222b371321915ac873b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9824e35db67adb5cc4302a0b4502e625&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-590c0b01f871d7106a8082f4d00f34e1</data>
