      <data key="d1">"Health professionals are crucial in creating a therapeutic climate that has a therapeutic effect and is essential for adherence to treatment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Health professionals are people who work in the health sector, providing care and services to patients."&lt;SEP&gt;"Healthcare professionals play an important role in supporting families."&lt;SEP&gt;"Profissionais de Saúde are healthcare professionals who provide guidance and support to mothers during breastfeeding."&lt;SEP&gt;"Profissionais de Saúde include healthcare professionals who provide care and support to patients."&lt;SEP&gt;"Profissionais de Saúde refer to healthcare professionals who work with Pessoas com Sobrepeso ou Obesidade."&lt;SEP&gt;"Profissionais de Saúde refers to healthcare professionals who provide care and support for mothers and children."&lt;SEP&gt;"Profissionais de Saúde are healthcare professionals who can realize mental health care in the Basic Attention."&lt;SEP&gt;"Profissionais de Saúde are healthcare professionals who provide care to individuals in need."&lt;SEP&gt;"Profissionais de Saúde are individuals who work in healthcare."&lt;SEP&gt;"Health professionals should counsel all smokers to quit smoking in routine appointments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Healthcare professionals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Professionals in health are organizations that provide healthcare services, including guidance on physical activity and healthy lifestyles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Professionals in health work with the Department of Attention to Health to provide healthcare services and guidance on physical activity.&lt;"|&gt;"healthcare service, professional collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"Profissionais de Saúde is an organization that provides care and support to patients, with a focus on promoting supported self-care and community-based care."&lt;SEP&gt;"Profissionais de saúde are healthcare professionals who work with patients to promote health and prevent disease."&lt;SEP&gt;"Profissionais de saúde are healthcare professionals responsible for providing primary care services."&lt;SEP&gt;"health professionals are a group mentioned in the context of health guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Os profissionais de saúde devem ser treinados para abordar as questões relativas à sexualidade das pessoas idosas de forma sensível e respeitosa."&lt;SEP&gt;"health professionals such as doctors, nurses, and other healthcare workers."</data>
