    <node id="&quot;DOENÇA CRÔNICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Doença Crônica é uma condição de saúde que requer acompanhamento contínuo."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chronic Disease is a type of disease that persists or recurs over a long period of time, often requiring ongoing medical attention."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chronic Disease is an event related to long-term health conditions that require ongoing care and management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Doença Crônica refers to a chronic disease that requires ongoing management and care."&lt;SEP&gt;"Doença crônica is a chronic disease that persists over time and requires ongoing management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Doença crônica is a concept that refers to a medical condition that persists over time, often requiring ongoing management and care."&lt;SEP&gt;"Doença crônica is a long-term health condition that requires ongoing care and management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Doença crônica refers to a chronic disease, which can be managed but not cured."&lt;SEP&gt;"Doença crônica refers to a chronic health condition, such as obesity or diabetes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Doença Crônica is a condition that persists over time, requiring ongoing management and care."&lt;SEP&gt;"Doença Crônica is a condition that requires attention and management to prevent complications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Doença crônica refers to a long-term illness that can be exacerbated by smoking and related health issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chronic disease refers to a long-term health condition, in this case, diabetes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chronic disease refers to long-term health conditions, such as diabetes and hypertension."&lt;SEP&gt;"Doença Crônica refers to a chronic disease."&lt;SEP&gt;"Doença crônica is a type of condição crônica that requires ongoing management."</data>
