      <data key="d1">"Cancer is a disease characterized by uncontrolled cell growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cancer is a group of diseases characterized by uncontrolled cell growth and division, which can be caused by various factors such as genetics and environmental exposures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cancer is a group of diseases characterized by uncontrolled cell growth and tumor formation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Há aumento do risco de câncer em aproximadamente 40%, e especificamente de fígado, pâncreas, endométrio, cólon, mama e bexiga."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Câncer refers to a significant health problem worldwide, causing physical, psychological, social, and economic impact for patients and their families."&lt;SEP&gt;"Câncer is a medical condition characterized by uncontrolled cell growth and tumor formation."&lt;SEP&gt;"câncer is a type of disease that can be caused or exacerbated by tobacco use."&lt;SEP&gt;"Câncer is a type of disease that can be detected through early screening and monitoring."&lt;SEP&gt;"Câncer refers to cancer, which is the focus of Nacional do Câncer (INCA)'s work."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-af2903b5966a2d1a0c94cb64ab99f6f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6beca60189c42b9a7da1f38cff3f2c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99fff7478bf2bd3b95b8c70cfcdf01e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a57899afeecf16ccd44c263ca48b2232&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d4229fd3bd102d19b0eda5f25ce65a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b14f7a93d37b8c17c5bed60ccac0b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1cb57f68554f3eb3f9b3682d73c3aea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb48f275d2aaec081ee6d55b1165e556&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0808f4adcc3c56f569210cf5195e62f2</data>
