    <node id="&quot;PASSO 1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PASSO 1 is the first step in the guide."&lt;SEP&gt;"Passo 1 is an event where problems and/or difficulties are identified and recognized by the patient."&lt;SEP&gt;"Passo 1 is the first step in the Dez Passos initiative, which recommends exclusive breastfeeding until six months."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-711d0632ecf547f2222fd62369704bae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4356949cfdcdd3e17423eb3f9de2b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b669c82b70032336ce5137c18fddbafe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PASSO 2&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PASSO 2 is the second step in the guide."&lt;SEP&gt;"Passo 2 is an event where a goal is set based on the identified problems and difficulties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Passo 2 is the second step in the Dez Passos initiative, which recommends introducing complementary foods at six months."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-711d0632ecf547f2222fd62369704bae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4356949cfdcdd3e17423eb3f9de2b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b669c82b70032336ce5137c18fddbafe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PASSO 3&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PASSO 3 is the third step in the guide."&lt;SEP&gt;"Passo 3 is an event where the goal is implemented, and the patient's progress is evaluated."&lt;SEP&gt;"Passo 3 is the third step in the Dez Passos initiative, which recommends providing three meals a day to children who are receiving breast milk."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-711d0632ecf547f2222fd62369704bae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4356949cfdcdd3e17423eb3f9de2b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b669c82b70032336ce5137c18fddbafe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PASSO 4&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Passo 4 is an event where the goal is achieved, and the patient receives a reward or a new set of goals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Passo 4 is the fourth step in the Dez Passos initiative, which emphasizes the importance of feeding children at regular intervals and respecting their appetite."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b669c82b70032336ce5137c18fddbafe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4356949cfdcdd3e17423eb3f9de2b8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROFISSIONAL DE SAÚDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A health professional who provides care and support to patients."&lt;SEP&gt;"A healthcare professional."&lt;SEP&gt;"Health professional refers to a person responsible for conducting medical evaluations, including sensory testing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Profissionais de Saúde are healthcare professionals who provide guidance and support to patients."&lt;SEP&gt;"Profissionais da Atenção Básica são responsáveis por realizar ações educativas para evitar e prevenir acidentes."&lt;SEP&gt;"O profissional de saúde é uma pessoa treinada para cuidar da saúde mental das crianças e adolescentes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Profissional de Saúde refers to healthcare professionals."&lt;SEP&gt;"profissional de Saúde is a healthcare provider."&lt;SEP&gt;"Health professional."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Profissional de Saúde is a healthcare professional responsible for providing guidance and support to individuals seeking to quit smoking."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Profissional de Saúde is a healthcare professional who helps users quit smoking."&lt;SEP&gt;"Professionals of health have a challenge in orienting changes in food consumption for healthy eating."&lt;SEP&gt;"Profissional de saúde is the healthcare professional who works with the usuário and their família to promote health and prevent disease."&lt;SEP&gt;"The healthcare professional is an organization responsible for providing healthcare services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The healthcare professional is involved in providing care and support for the person with a condition crônica."&lt;SEP&gt;"A healthcare professional who is providing guidance on breastfeeding."&lt;SEP&gt;"A healthcare professional."&lt;SEP&gt;"O profissional de saúde tem um papel fundamental em ajudar a mulher a tomar decisões e a desenvolver sua confiança."&lt;SEP&gt;"O profissional de saúde é responsável por oferecer suporte e orientação à mãe sobre desmame e alimentação complementar."&lt;SEP&gt;"Os profissionais de saúde podem precisar usar habilidade especializada para lidar com mães que têm necessidades especiais e facilitar o manejo do aleitamento materno."&lt;SEP&gt;"A healthcare professional who provides medical services and advice to patients."</data>
