    <node id="&quot;GUIA ALIMENTAR PARA A POPULAÇÃO BRASILEIRA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A guide or manual for the Brazilian population about food or nutrition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Guia Alimentar para a População Brasileira is a guidebook for healthy eating and nutrition in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"O Guia Alimentar para a População Brasileira é uma publicação que recomenda o consumo diário de frutas, legumes e verduras."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guia Alimentar is a document that provides guidance on healthy eating for the Brazilian population."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guia Alimentar is a document that provides nutritional recommendations and guidelines for the Brazilian population."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guia Alimentar para a População Brasileira is a concept related to dietary guidelines for the Brazilian population."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guia Alimentar para a População Brasileira is a nutrition guide for the Brazilian population."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guide to Healthy Eating for the Brazilian Population is a document published by the Ministry of Health that provides guidance on healthy eating habits and nutrition recommendations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Guia Alimentar para a População Brasileira is a publication that provides recommendations for healthy eating habits in Brazil."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-29940da4efd6b2ff6d71dbb6551190bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a8cf2c61f6c544b312a67194e9fb361&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f81f4594a00ed9200f155cbc073a8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a30c8f5bc09fcca651b1482f6a1bbf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c5d988da2c4430b23199bac5a626009&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-530b20e2ede8be5a106def96887f51b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58175ac2beafbc2393a2b8e019653dd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4356949cfdcdd3e17423eb3f9de2b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb25ca4bd879fe6213ebbc169c35f1aa</data>
    </node>
