    <node id="&quot;USUÁRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An individual who receives healthcare services from a health professional."&lt;SEP&gt;"Person or family member receiving care."&lt;SEP&gt;"usuário is a general term for a user or individual receiving healthcare services."&lt;SEP&gt;"usuário refers to an individual who uses the service, often without seeking it out due to feelings of obesity and shame."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User is the person receiving the care and support from the professionals."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user refers to an individual receiving medical attention and treatment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The usuário refers to an individual experiencing a crisis, emphasizing their agency and autonomy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Users, on the other hand, have their own subjetivities and experiences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Usuário refers to individuals seeking healthcare services."&lt;SEP&gt;"usuário refers to an individual receiving healthcare services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The usuário (user) is a key figure in the process of tabagismo cessation, requiring personalized attention and guidance throughout their journey."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user can benefit from the guidance and services provided by the Ministry of Health on healthy lifestyles.&lt;"|&gt;"health guidance, public service"&lt;SEP&gt;"The user is a person who can be encouraged to make lifestyle changes and adopt healthier habits."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user is a person who seeks healthcare services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user is mentioned as someone who can receive recommendations on healthy eating."&lt;SEP&gt;"The usuário is an individual who receives personalized nutrition plans and guidance from a nutricionista, emphasizing the patient-centered approach."&lt;SEP&gt;"Usuário is the individual who experiences a condição crônica and must manage their own health."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User seeks guidance on test-related information, showing awareness of vulnerability and risk."&lt;SEP&gt;"User/Usuário refers to an individual who receives care and guidance related to HIV/AIDS."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5b5e275006cd71a7686e3fb3c19ad7de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f40d73959502367ec1058f9c2efb4fbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cee23520b7df16b0f6caba9875e4eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a733905e4714deb34763b87bf8d55f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43b486a8a7e0fb50a5ae67c99c757a19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-120078459904153181af5c4478fae03c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-737879f65dc2b853a66d034dc8445c5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0600cc19752de29a3d163c3985c328&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec8863f44e4c7dace4590f5b903e4bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9797904778f869161cec7b5d0f0b637&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5b500e7e472d02eb449ad5ba8082be5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9658b542919326ade93724d7be814205&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c6b053452d35e831fddb05e4ab7f99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f90ad9506dc1f3f363b250c308cf8f42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e605f7382a3d66a1468a89ea73601173&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5be53d0e30810ab5c32f2921b9ad9b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-489dcd25f808bc8ee9db3715f1f251ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae8c695990aff27d247569ec6c4fc98</data>
