      <data key="d1">"A health care facility or department that provides primary and preventive medical care to patients."&lt;SEP&gt;"A unidade de Saúde é um serviço que fornece cuidado às pessoas em situações de vulnerabilidade."&lt;SEP&gt;"Health units are places where health professionals can provide care and support to individuals who have been victims of violence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Unidade de Saúde refers to a basic health unit that provides healthcare services to the community."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Unidade de Saúde is a healthcare unit where most workers are local residents who participated in the struggle for land ownership, creating a sense of solidarity and sensitivity to care."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Unidade de Saúde is a healthcare unit responsible for coordinating activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Unidade de Saúde is an organization that provides basic attention to people, including health services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Unidade de Saúde refers to a healthcare unit that provides medical care and services to the community."</data>
