    <node id="&quot;LEITE MATERNO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Breast milk is a unique substance that provides the baby with optimal nutrition and promotes healthy growth and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Breast milk is recommended for infants until 6 months of age."&lt;SEP&gt;"Breast milk is the primary source of nutrition for infants and young children."&lt;SEP&gt;"Breast milk"&lt;SEP&gt;"Leite Materno is the breast milk produced by mothers for their babies, emphasizing its nutritional value."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leite Materno is the human milk, rich in nutrients and factors of protection for infants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leite Materno is the milk produced by human mothers, which contains specific nutrients and has a composition similar to that of all women worldwide."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leite Materno refers to breast milk, which is recommended as the best method of nutrition for infants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leite materno is a type of milk produced by mothers for their babies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leite materno refers to breast milk, which serves as the primary source of nutrition for infants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leite materno refers to the milk produced by a mother's body during breastfeeding."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leite materno é um tipo de alimento que fornece nutrientes para a criança."&lt;SEP&gt;"O leite materno é rico em anticorpos e varia ao longo de uma mamada e também com a dieta da mãe."&lt;SEP&gt;"O leite materno é uma fonte de nutrição importante para a criança."&lt;SEP&gt;"breast milk is a type of nutrition."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-bb27b0d0f843229c4362efd22629b3e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-907da0e23b871deecabf6c3bc0d4866e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6611ecebcb218b105d5f5e56abd40fe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2e12443782c0a0bcc40fbdd3a96f909&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35647ea59c96581e047ccab25a51421c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78b49b43774b87fac5b807072941eddf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e5ebe64151a8e84f5d0afb2d388a538&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aa0a77e68ba54a471588219ced8ade6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9824e35db67adb5cc4302a0b4502e625&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba7f0a088f724c6ed0bc79bf9806da80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fecfbe3049f700def85bfa1341220214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2e50ce0ef2209f162e71fe528b8e528&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2ae17f96b11dee5ed57b300e3eeefba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f65a9dbc8be8e5da1ca6d3a665cdcf82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a57ab9b4d74fad769a77a4833169c82</data>
