    <node id="&quot;SUS &quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-00b178b50574e94e266596befae28ef8</data>
      <data key="d1">"The health ministry of Brazil works closely with the public health system to provide comprehensive healthcare services to its citizens."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DOENÇAS CRÔNICAS NÃO TRANSMISSÍVEIS &quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-00b178b50574e94e266596befae28ef8</data>
      <data key="d1">"Obesity is one of many non-communicable diseases that are prevalent in Brazil, highlighting the need for integrated disease management."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OBESIDADE &quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-00b178b50574e94e266596befae28ef8</data>
      <data key="d1">"The IBGE reports on the prevalence of obesity in Brazil, highlighting its importance as a public health concern."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MINISTÉRIO DA SAÚDE | SECRETARIA DE ATENÇÃO À SAÚDE | DEPARTAMENTO DE ATENÇÃO BÁSICA &quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-68f1894fee8ec8973959c5da27dbc165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89a7be0de091ae674719002bc69923cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed670db07abcbf6faa4bd86f6354f93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb09e1c29d8b25dfc9b9ed338718214</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ministério da Saúde | Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde | Departamento de Atenção Básica is a government department responsible for healthcare in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health, Department of Attention to Health, and Department of Basic Care are governmental entities responsible for health policies and guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Unidade Básica de Saúde is responsible for implementing the strategies developed by the Ministério da Saúde to care for people with chronic diseases, including obesity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ministério da Saúde | Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde | Departamento de Atenção Básica is an organization focused on healthcare and wellness."</data>
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATA DA ÚLTIMA MENSTRUAÇÃO &quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-76c04ba1e4fb949ee77d055a715ba628</data>
      <data key="d1">"The date of the last menstrual period is used to calculate the DUM, indicating a relationship between the two events."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXAME DE ULTRASSONOGRAFIA OBSTÉTRICA &quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-76c04ba1e4fb949ee77d055a715ba628</data>
      <data key="d1">"The determination of the gestational age can be affected by an unknown date of the last menstrual period, and the exame de ultrassonografia obstétrica is used to confirm it."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DUM DESCONHECIDA &quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-76c04ba1e4fb949ee77d055a715ba628</data>
      <data key="d1">"The date of the last menstrual period is used to calculate the DUM, indicating a relationship between the two events."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRASIL &quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-76c04ba1e4fb949ee77d055a715ba628</data>
      <data key="d1">"The guidelines for calculating the DUM mentioned in 2006a are relevant to the country of Brasil."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONCEPT&quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-72425852cd3b261f8159a651be7bb1cc</data>
      <data key="d1">"Consuming refrigerantes e doces is not recommended for pregnant women due to their high sugar content and potential negative effects on health."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CADERNOS DE ATENÇÃO BÁSICA, Nº 35 &quot;&lt;/|&gt;&quot;CULLEN; BARANOWSKI; SMITH &quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-f3e59d2d587bdebedc6d62e5c3e7c854</data>
