    <node id="&quot;DIABETES MELLITUS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"HEALTH CONDITION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Diabetes Mellitus is a chronic disease affecting blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes Mellitus is a chronic disease characterized by high blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes Mellitus is a condition affecting the body's ability to regulate blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes Mellitus is a disease affecting individuals with high blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes Mellitus is a health condition that can lead to complications such as ulcers on the feet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes Mellitus is a medical condition characterized by high blood sugar levels, requiring management through diet, exercise, and medication."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes Mellitus is a metabolic disorder characterized by high blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes Mellitus is a metabolic disorder characterized by hyperglycemia and disturbances in carbohydrate, protein, and fat metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes Mellitus is a health condition affecting blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes Mellitus is a condition that can be impacted by quitting smoking."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes is a chronic condition affecting the body's ability to regulate blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes is a medical condition that requires careful management, and some medications like bupropiona may interact with it."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes is a chronic disease characterized by high blood sugar levels, affecting millions worldwide."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes is a metabolic disorder affecting glucose regulation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes mellitus is a condition characterized by high levels of glucose in the blood, which can lead to various health problems."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes mellitus is a health condition related to high blood sugar."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes mellitus refers to a specific chronic condition that requires individualized management and monitoring."&lt;SEP&gt;"O diabetes mellitus é mencionado em relação ao tabagismo."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes mellitus refers to a medical condition characterized by high blood sugar levels, which requires management and treatment."&lt;SEP&gt;"O Diabetes mellitus é uma doença que pode ser considerada como um fator de risco cardiovascular."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes Mellitus is a form of diabetes, referring to an overarching condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes Mellitus is a health condition affecting two idosos who maintain independence and need help for various activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetes mellitus is another major risk factor contributing to cardiovascular diseases and is often mentioned alongside HAS."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5d5920bb7af8aa253219a73b99d372ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121a2e1016b50132ca5171a482851182&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d066a6d91faeb3adb8f2f580f60d72f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-530b20e2ede8be5a106def96887f51b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3905afbe94fd8ffb32bda603515d7f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9775240b6d295f79522d33428f2823d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9164b3575819d73e22cda57cef1652a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2719c5ac33e4d4354d6e811f32b4f68c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed1859ee7dd556bd6b8b44370e416b74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c1f2cf8710795715adb1e0cfc5928a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d7ae9031cba3be486096f40b70f5257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0071e16106ef52a6036e41e0d54d77b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8662c1bde799dfa0466be1e7bbc482fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79857b6804b89e3fd2bcf73e6c18671c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-475901e2a8f720f97d17a4628f36e62c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6982cf132ff2405a71b0bfc86a6d2d62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-114876ac7cf1cce8197492b97690da0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07bc1e08d2366b5013f7b32aedabcb11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89e8d9694bc56b2df9df5ab0a1d78d0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49dccea51b477526b98eec009ec27a95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c04d70bebb4aa5902780a6a08f961ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-701f37cf5de9362ef19d462328813148&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba87da61558bdc9d77d6e9ffe160c3d5</data>
