    <node id="&quot;ESTRATÉGIAS PARA O CUIDADO DA PESSOA COM DOENÇA CRÔNICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"ESTRATÉGIAS PARA O CUIDADO DA PESSOA COM DOENÇA CRÔNICA is a strategy being discussed in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Estratégias para o cuidado da pessoa com doença crônica is a strategy for caring for individuals with chronic diseases, specifically diabetes mellitus."&lt;SEP&gt;"ESTRATÉGIAS PARA O CUIDADO DA PESSOA COM DOENÇA CRÔNICA is a strategy document developed by the MINISTÉRIO DA SAÚDE for chronic disease care."&lt;SEP&gt;"Estratégias para o cuidado da pessoa com doença crônica is an organization focused on healthcare and wellness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Strategies for caring for people with chronic disease are approaches to managing and treating patients with ongoing health conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"ESTRATÉGIAS PARA O CUIDADO DA PESSOA COM DOENÇA CRÔNICA refers to strategies for caring for people with chronic disease."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-53e0fbc40a7e3b5a160c78ef2fe9a876&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8662c1bde799dfa0466be1e7bbc482fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72c0982ce32e4738bb1a2f466150a02d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68f1894fee8ec8973959c5da27dbc165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9819b39c6cde4d44581e9d745c38d4f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5caa8c234bba63e9ea7999d49c71c472</data>
    </node>
