      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rename 2012 is a pharmaceutical reference guide that contains information about anti-hipertensives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rename 2012 is a reference system for medications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rename 2012 refers to the Brazilian pharmacological reference guide that provides information on medications, dosages, and interactions."</data>
