      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Quadro 1 is an event that presents a classification of grades of recommendation proposed by the Oxford Centre for Evidence Based Medicine."&lt;SEP&gt;"Quadro 1 refers to the Oxford Centre for Evidence Based Medicine classification of evidence levels and study types, used in the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Quadro 1 is not mentioned in the text, but Quadro 2 is. I assume it's a mistake and it should be Quadro 2 instead."&lt;SEP&gt;"Table summarizing effects of passive smoking on human health."</data>
