      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tabela 2 presents elements that suggest Diabetes Mellitus diagnosis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabela 2 refers to a table that classifies blood pressure values."&lt;SEP&gt;"Table 2 is a table or list of data mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabela 2 refers to a table that summarizes recommendations for breast cancer screening in different age groups."</data>
