    <node id="&quot;DM TIPO 2&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"DM tipo 2 refers to Diabetes Mellitus Type 2, which is a condition that affects glucose regulation in the body."&lt;SEP&gt;"DM tipo 2 refers to Type 2 Diabetes."&lt;SEP&gt;"DM tipo 2 refers to a type of diabetes mellitus affecting individuals with high blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"DM tipo 2 refers to a type of diabetes that requires non-pharmacological treatment, complemented with oral antidiabetic drugs and insulin in some cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"DM tipo 2 refers to a type of diabetes, specifically Type 2, which is also mentioned in the context of complications and management."&lt;SEP&gt;"DM tipo 2 refers to type 2 diabetes, a form of diabetes that develops over time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Type 2 Diabetes is an event that occurs when the body becomes resistant to insulin, leading to high blood sugar levels."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f8fbdcca6142a11665b95bb70d17aa20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1744672d55b425d8791890a2f9d3ceb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba87da61558bdc9d77d6e9ffe160c3d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f81f4594a00ed9200f155cbc073a8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b822941bcac6eb7d49ac29cd7927c369&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-381f2769dbafd10297d024c5d9e997bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6d06a5132611f9acdf1b2708a6502ba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DESCOMPENSAÇÃO HIPERGLICÊMICA AGUDA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Descompensação hiperglicêmica aguda is an event related to acute hyperglycemic decompensation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The document discusses an acute hyperglycemic decompensation, which is a serious complication of diabetes mellitus."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-44c1e651523cacc7a4cbe150611c516b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba87da61558bdc9d77d6e9ffe160c3d5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HIPOGLICEMIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DISEASE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hipoglicemia refers to a condition characterized by abnormally low blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hipoglicemia refers to a condition where blood sugar levels are abnormally low, which can be caused by diabetes medication or other factors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hypoglycemia is a condition characterized by low blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hypoglycemia is a condition where blood glucose levels are too low."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hipoglicemia refers to abnormally low blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hipoglicemia refers to low blood sugar levels, which can be a concern for individuals with diabetes who are taking medications or experiencing fluctuations in their diet and exercise routines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hypoglycemia refers to low blood glucose levels."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-56d3b1e9551cf1562bdde7429d87400d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a58e70df110c7e4065b2fd9174ff5cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2aec6be4c7bee1e546e8178355b886b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba87da61558bdc9d77d6e9ffe160c3d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ec7e793644f66b20771251148afdb88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a040fa037220ae7a638ca6c2227b1820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8329b5264a11203795c34d3c6a9c942</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DOENÇA MACROVASCULAR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONDITION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Doença macrovascular refers to a condition affecting the large blood vessels, often associated with diabetes mellitus."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ba87da61558bdc9d77d6e9ffe160c3d5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DOENÇA MICROVASCULAR E NEUROPÁTICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONDITION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Doença microvascular e neuropática refers to a condition affecting the small blood vessels and nerves, often associated with diabetes mellitus."&lt;SEP&gt;"Doença microvascular e neuropática refers to complications related to diabetes that affect blood vessels and nerves."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d6d06a5132611f9acdf1b2708a6502ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba87da61558bdc9d77d6e9ffe160c3d5</data>
    </node>
