    <node id="&quot;INSULINA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Insulin is a hormone that regulates blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insulin is a medical treatment used for managing DM tipo 2, particularly in cases requiring complex treatment regimens."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insulin is a medication used in the treatment of diabetes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insulin is a substance used to regulate blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insulina is a hormone that plays a crucial role in glucose regulation and metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insulina is a hormone that regulates blood glucose levels, often used to treat diabetes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insulina is a hormone that regulates blood sugar levels and can be used to treat diabetes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insulina is a medication used to regulate blood sugar levels in individuals with Diabetes Mellitus."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insulina is an organization that produces a medication for diabetes treatment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insulina refers to the hormone responsible for regulating blood glucose levels, used in the treatment of diabetes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insulina is a hormone used to regulate blood sugar levels in individuals with diabetes, and can also cause hypoglycemia when administered."&lt;SEP&gt;"Insulina is a medication used to treat diabetes, particularly in the elderly."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-56d3b1e9551cf1562bdde7429d87400d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79857b6804b89e3fd2bcf73e6c18671c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2719c5ac33e4d4354d6e811f32b4f68c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a58e70df110c7e4065b2fd9174ff5cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2aec6be4c7bee1e546e8178355b886b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c41ab4c01aaf6236e636f5c9a41053f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b822941bcac6eb7d49ac29cd7927c369&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3f055a5b6d63868db25071d0851e9cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-426b29b92f60041de4f1f5a07b2d052c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1744672d55b425d8791890a2f9d3ceb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ec7e793644f66b20771251148afdb88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-519195a90f75760f68b6de2970b8be42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8329b5264a11203795c34d3c6a9c942</data>
