    <node id="&quot;DM TIPO 1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"DM tipo 1 refers to Type 1 Diabetes, an event or condition affecting the body's ability to regulate blood sugar levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"DM tipo 1 refers to Type 1 Diabetes."&lt;SEP&gt;"DM tipo 1 refers to a type of diabetes that requires specific evaluation and treatment."&lt;SEP&gt;"DM tipo 1 refers to a type of diabetes, specifically Type 1, which is mentioned in the context of complications and management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Type 1 Diabetes is an event that occurs when the body's immune system attacks and destroys insulin-producing cells in the pancreas, leading to high blood sugar levels."</data>
