      <data key="d1">"Cetoacidosis is a complication of diabetes mellitus."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cetoacidosis is an event that occurs when the body produces ketones due to high blood sugar levels, which can lead to serious complications if left untreated."&lt;SEP&gt;"The document discusses ketoacidosis, a life-threatening condition resulting from insulin deficiency or relative insufficiency."</data>
