      <data key="d1">"A state of physical or mental tension caused by a demanding situation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Estresse refers to the emotional state that can trigger a desire to smoke."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stress is a concept referring to physical or emotional tension that can cause changes in blood sugar levels and contribute to the development of diabetes."</data>
