    <node id="&quot;AUTOCUIDADO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Autocuidado is a concept that involves people taking care of themselves, their families, and communities, with support from healthcare institutions and professionals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Autocuidado is mentioned as a concept involving participation and support for the person with a condition crônica."&lt;SEP&gt;"Autocuidado refers to self-care and assistance in managing health conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Self-care is a crucial aspect of diabetes management, emphasizing patient empowerment and responsibility for their own health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Autocuidado refers to self-care practices and activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Autocuidado refers to the practice of self-care and managing one's own health, including physical, emotional, and social well-being."&lt;SEP&gt;"Autocuidado refers to the self-care approach in managing chronic diseases, emphasizing individual responsibility and shared care between professionals."</data>
