    <node id="&quot;NEUROPATIA DIABÉTICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SYMPTOM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Diabetic neuropathy affects nerve function, leading to various symptoms including urinary incontinence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diabetic neuropathy is a complication of diabetes that affects the nervous system and can cause various symptoms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Neuropathic pain, numbness, and weakness are complications of diabetes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Neuropatia Diabética is an organization that encompasses a set of clinical syndromes affecting the peripheral nervous system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Neuropatia diabética refers to a type of nerve damage associated with diabetes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Neuropatia diabética refers to diabetic neuropathy, a condition where nerve damage occurs due to high blood sugar levels."</data>
