    <node id="&quot;TABAGISMO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Abuse of tobacco."&lt;SEP&gt;"O tabagismo é um problema de saúde pública que afeta as pessoas de todas as idades."&lt;SEP&gt;"Smoking is a habit of inhaling tobacco smoke."&lt;SEP&gt;"Smoking or tobacco use is the central focus of this text, highlighting its negative impacts and strategies for cessation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo is a condition characterized by tobacco use, which can lead to various health problems."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to smoking and tobacco use as a health risk factor."&lt;SEP&gt;"tabagismo is the habit of smoking, which can be a risk factor for people with diabetes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the act of smoking cigarettes, which involves inhaling nicotine and experiencing its effects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the act of smoking or using tobacco, which is a major risk factor for various health issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the habit of smoking or using other forms of tobacco, which is a major cause of preventable morbidity and mortality worldwide."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the habit of smoking tobacco products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the habit of smoking tobacco, associated with various risks for both pregnant women and their children."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the habit of smoking, which has significant health implications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the habit of smoking."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the use of tobacco products, which has various health consequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the use of tobacco products, which have significant health implications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the use of tobacco products, which poses a risk to public health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the use or consumption of tobacco products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the use or control of tobacco products."&lt;SEP&gt;"The act of smoking"&lt;SEP&gt;"Tobacco smoking is a concept that involves the inhalation and combustion of tobacco products."&lt;SEP&gt;"O tabagismo é apresentado como um fator de risco importante para doenças cardiovasculares."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the habit of smoking tobacco."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the use of tobacco products, which have negative effects on cardiovascular health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo is a risk factor for oral cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo refers to the use and addiction to tobacco products, which can have significant negative impacts on health and well-being."</data>
