    <node id="&quot;SECRETARIA DE ATENÇÃO A SAÚDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">Here is a comprehensive summary of the data provided:

**SECRETARIA DE ATENÇÃO A SAÚDE**

The Secretaria de Atención a Saúde, also known as the Department of Attention to Health or the Secretary of Health Attention, is a department within the Ministry of Health in Brazil. It is responsible for providing attention to health needs and promoting healthy behaviors through various programs and services.

The department focuses on healthcare services and policies, including primary care, health promotion, and disease prevention. It works closely with the Ministry of Health to improve health outcomes and provide guidance on physical activity and healthy lifestyles.

Specifically, the Secretaria de Atenção a Saúde is responsible for:

* Providing attention to health needs in Brazil
* Promoting health through physical activities and exercises
* Providing healthcare services, including guidance on physical activity and healthy lifestyles
* Overseeing health care policies and programs within the Ministry of Health
* Focusing on primary care services and providing health-related information

The department works with various stakeholders, including the public, to improve health outcomes and prevent diseases. It also provides support for individuals affected by congenital diseases like phenylketonuria.

Overall, the Secretaria de Atención a Saúde plays a critical role in promoting healthy behaviors and preventing diseases in Brazil, and its work is closely aligned with the goals of the Ministry of Health.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-737879f65dc2b853a66d034dc8445c5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70f2949c8b2394125303348585e7d9e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-530b20e2ede8be5a106def96887f51b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ed6ff4c80573a0bfe8b2bb7fcbef8e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a28d05b4cf8eaf908988266c2e1d575&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e39bc524b34204d61e2332228250ebb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a98afd43f846fed0e7388f77212a5259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d06f87d2c657ca58fd7aba54b23b8d68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2be3e07a2e156aebd322421ddd280ab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5630cba30c7f8da3d1cfb9a167a29782&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-016cef459c1bdb29f18120016aed13e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99fff7478bf2bd3b95b8c70cfcdf01e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee8a75f38b06617cd5018d157e8355a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89e2ac94c94d099dd76fc859fbf6d4e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9f02322094ac9d526bb0e64762f9904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8969359d91aa9bcbef176073fd9006cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50061d3dc696c78c79ca8a7e90e3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ae29116b2fb71e6b393dd39416b4166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea28e07113a5700f957762296d96fe33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b4d2c010452f1f864b090c232307dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d1c6dad3b66e968fd78ffaaae808d73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee6356d5739e626ec63aefbb50a28651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-363bc71d2a5aa7261ac4675c2714feb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6a57c58bb09415e02b9409595e54728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c0c783e23a8986eaa92169dfaa8fb40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ac85076586e0ddf782c11f184d69626&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-160595fa9586ea073a3de7cdeefb1fe7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbd52194582933b70baa0304d0591a2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8728762326812a75c6257267058f1293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb48f275d2aaec081ee6d55b1165e556&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9d37c5fcad363fc9696a4f8137decd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f40d73959502367ec1058f9c2efb4fbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41acceb866dee911466113db248ff66f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d497001181726b1bb9867b1ae9e20d1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1949f890dcf71789af5a2958cae81f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-120078459904153181af5c4478fae03c</data>
