      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The text does not mention Washington, it mentions "communications with Washington" which is a location"&lt;SEP&gt;"There is no mention of Washington in the text, please disregard."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is a geo location, mentioned as the place where communications with the team are received."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is a location referenced in the text as a center for communication and decision-making."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is a city in Alemaia, and also a department of government responsible for health care and disease management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is a location mentioned in relation to health-related publications or events."</data>
