    <node id="&quot;CRESCIMENTO E DESENVOLVIMENTO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Child growth and development are essential for families."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crescimento e Desenvolvimento (Growth and Development) is a publication by the Ministry of Health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crescimento e Desenvolvimento refers to a complex transformation process that includes growth, maturation, learning, and social aspects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crescimento e Desenvolvimento refers to the growth and maturation processes that occur throughout life, influenced by vital forces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Growth and development are essential aspects of child nutrition and monitoring."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-29e111be732d4a638ce82bf75e2f45f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c7c4d19c5987039ebca6c0ab688024e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fa0ae9ff0b916c6c7d859dcddbecc6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1936a9cac4eabc506ad11f2d07a0af35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1b255d655fa0c39742796999b2aa106</data>
