      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Caderneta de Saúde da Criança é um documento que ajuda a acompanhar o crescimento e desenvolvimento da criança."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caderneta de Saúde da Criança is an electronic medical record system used by healthcare providers to track children's health."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Caderneta de Saúde da Criança is a document that records valuable information about a child's health, which can be used by various professionals and services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Caderneta de Saúde da Criança is a tool for tracking a child's health and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Child Health Record is a document used to record and track the health information of children."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Child's Health Record is a document used to track the child's health and development from birth to 2 years old."</data>
