    <node id="&quot;SAÚDE DA CRIANÇA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A department or entity mentioned in relation to child health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Child Health is a concept related to the overall well-being of infants and young children."&lt;SEP&gt;"Child Health is a focus area of Rede Cegonha, aiming to improve the health and well-being of children from birth to 2 years old."&lt;SEP&gt;"Child Health is an organization or topic mentioned in the context of child health care guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Child health refers to the overall well-being and development of children."&lt;SEP&gt;"Child health, an area of focus for the Ministry of Health in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"Children's health is a critical aspect of family development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Criança is an event or occurrence that affects children's health and well-being."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Criança is an organization responsible for providing health services to children."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Criança refere-se ao bem-estar físico, emocional e social de uma criança."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Criança refers to the growth and development of children, which involves balancing vital forces and maintaining health."&lt;SEP&gt;"saúde da criança refers to the growth and development of children, which involves balancing vital forces and maintaining health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program for child health"&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Criança is a department that deals with healthcare."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Criança is a health program aimed at promoting the well-being of children in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Criança is the health of children, a priority for pediatricians and caregivers."</data>
