      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Mãe is the mother who is breastfeeding her child, and the topic revolves around her experiences and challenges."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Mãe's health and well-being are crucial during pregnancy, as they directly affect the child's development."&lt;SEP&gt;"A mãe é uma figura importante na saúde do recém-nascido."&lt;SEP&gt;"As mães têm um papel importante na prevenção de acidentes e na promoção da segurança das crianças."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mothers are often the primary caregivers for children."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mãe is the mother who breastfeeds her child and receives guidance and support from Profissionais de Saúde."&lt;SEP&gt;"The mother."&lt;SEP&gt;"mother refers to a person who gives birth or raises a child."&lt;SEP&gt;"mãe refers to mothers who may fabricate diseases or symptoms in their children, a form of child abuse."&lt;SEP&gt;"The mother of F.F.S. has mental health problems, including delirium and hallucinations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The mother reports that the father does not visit the children regularly and they feel his absence."&lt;SEP&gt;"A mother who is the subject of the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"A mãe (mother) is an important figure in a child's life, and her role in providing nutrition and care is crucial."&lt;SEP&gt;"A mãe é a principal figura na decisão de desmamar e introduzir alimentos complementares."&lt;SEP&gt;"A mãe é um modelo de referência para a gestante, e seu apoio é fundamental."&lt;SEP&gt;"A mãe é uma figura central na amamentação e cuidado com o bebê."&lt;SEP&gt;"A mãe é uma figura central na amamentação simultânea, tendendo a ser auxiliada por outra pessoa."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mother"&lt;SEP&gt;"Mãe is a mother who provides care and support for her children."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mãe refers to a mother, who produces and provides human milk for her infant."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mãe é a figura materna que amamenta e cuida do bebê."&lt;SEP&gt;"The mother plays a crucial role in interacting with her baby, responding promptly to its needs, and fostering a harmonious relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"mãe is a woman who is pregnant or has given birth."&lt;SEP&gt;"the mother."</data>
