      <data key="d1">"A baby who is being fed by the mother."&lt;SEP&gt;"A bebê refers to a baby who benefits from breastfeeding, showing its impact on child development and health."&lt;SEP&gt;"A bebê refers to an infant who receives milk from its mother through breastfeeding."&lt;SEP&gt;"A newborn baby."&lt;SEP&gt;"Infants require close attention and care from their parents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Os bebês são vulneráveis a lesões (acidentes) em diversos contextos."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bebê is the baby who is being breastfed by the Mãe."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bebê is a person who can be affected by fungal infections and vasoespasmos."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bebê is the baby."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bebê refers to a baby, which has unique needs and challenges related to breastfeeding."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bebê refers to an infant or young child, who is fed with human milk and benefits from its factors of protection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bebê é o filho que recebe o leite materno da mãe durante o processo de amamentação."&lt;SEP&gt;"O bebê recebe o leite do final da mamada, que é mais calórico, promovendo a sua saciedade e maior espaçamento entre as mamadas."&lt;SEP&gt;"O bebê é o foco da atenção materna, precisando de alimento e cuidados para seu desenvolvimento."&lt;SEP&gt;"The baby has unique competencies and abilities that were previously ignored, such as recognizing its mother's face, voices, and smells."&lt;SEP&gt;"bebê is a baby or newborn child."</data>
