      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Health and development of children"&lt;SEP&gt;"SAÚDE DA CRIANÇA: CRESCIMENTO E DESENVOLVIMENTO is an organization or publication focused on child health, growth, and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"SAÚDE DA CRIANÇA: CRESCIMENTO E DESENVOLVIMENTO refers to child health and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Criança: Crescimento e Desenvolvimento is a health initiative that focuses on child growth and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Criança: Crescimento e Desenvolvimento is a publication or department within Ministério da Saúde."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Criança: Crescimento e Desenvolvimento is a report or document mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Criança: Crescimento e Desenvolvimento is an event or topic related to child health and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Criança: Crescimento e Desenvolvimento is an event that focuses on child health, growth, and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saúde da Criança: Crescimento e Desenvolvimento refers to a book chapter on child health and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"The book 'Saúde da Criança: Crescimento e Desenvolvimento' discusses child health and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"The book covers various aspects of child health, growth, and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"The publication 'Health of Children: Growth and Development' is a document outlining healthcare goals and policies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The topic 'Saúde da Criança: Crescimento e Desenvolvimento' discusses various aspects of child health, growth, and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"This book chapter discusses various aspects of children's health, growth, and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is an event related to child health, growth, and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is the title of a chapter in a book about child health, growth, and development."</data>
