    <node id="&quot;HOMEOPATIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"THERAPY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Homeopathy is a medical practice referenced as part of PNPIC."&lt;SEP&gt;"Homeopathy is a system of medicine developed by Samuel Hahnemann."&lt;SEP&gt;"Homeopatia is a medical approach that aims to restore health by stimulating the vital energy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Homeopatia is a system of alternative medicine that uses highly diluted substances to treat diseases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Homeopatia is a type of therapy."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-77c69e9ab745ae3e43ff9ad792191875&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eca2f1617f6b9e56b60a75c1bd7e914&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-096fdf6ffea742275884aec126788969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c778cc93d66267e64b71e490b73e9681&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eefbe451d14dccd5c0f0a6287bbeacd7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SAMUEL HAHNEMANN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Samuel Hahnemann was a German doctor who developed homeopathy, a complex medical system based on three fundamental principles: the law of similars, experimentation in healthy individuals, and infinitesimal doses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Samuel Hahnemann was the founder of Homeopatia."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-77c69e9ab745ae3e43ff9ad792191875&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df098a8572a7c563933a6d573d7a108</data>
