      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anamnese Homeopática is an interview method used by homeopaths to evaluate each case, observing what is most characteristic in the individual."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-096fdf6ffea742275884aec126788969</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VITALIDADE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Vitality refers to the life force or energy of the organism, which needs to be restored to maintain health."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-096fdf6ffea742275884aec126788969</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENFERMIDADE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Enfermidade refers to the imbalance or disease that occurs when the vital energy is disrupted."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-096fdf6ffea742275884aec126788969</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DESMAME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"O desmame é o último estágio da amamentação, marcando o fim do aleitamento."&lt;SEP&gt;"Weaning is an important milestone for children, but it can also lead to emotional turmoil and disruption of vital energy."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-096fdf6ffea742275884aec126788969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-752a853e91b37d79ca903604145cdd5f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PERÍODO DOS DENTES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The teething period is a common challenge for infants, causing discomfort and disrupting the balance of vital energy."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-096fdf6ffea742275884aec126788969</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANTROPOSOFIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Antroposofia is a philosophical and spiritual movement that emphasizes the unity of all living beings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Antroposofia is an espiritual science that views humanity as intimately linked to nature, with each entity contributing to a complex and harmonious whole."&lt;SEP&gt;"Antroposofia is a philosophical approach that considers human beings as a whole, integrating physical, psychic, and social dimensions, with an emphasis on individuality, autonomy, and holistic care."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-873efdd7b0f41ae152e5c93ad592b9fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb7d15392f764288485d63b556f33ca8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29e111be732d4a638ce82bf75e2f45f7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RUDOLF STEINER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rudolf Steiner was the Austrian philosopher who proposed Antroposofia in the 1920s as a guide for healthcare and human development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rudolf Steiner was the founder of Antroposofia, which emerged in the 1920s in Europe."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eb7d15392f764288485d63b556f33ca8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29e111be732d4a638ce82bf75e2f45f7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MEDICINA ANTROPOSÓFICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"THERAPY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Medicina Antroposófica is a complementary medical approach that aims to achieve integral care and health, based on vitalistic principles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medicina Antroposófica is an approach to medicine that emphasizes the holistic treatment of individuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medicina Antroposófica is a type of therapy."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2eca2f1617f6b9e56b60a75c1bd7e914&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29e111be732d4a638ce82bf75e2f45f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e6fb6f35f62490f81c9d3fc30d7949d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLARIDADES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"polaridades refer to the forces of expansion and contraction that manifest in human development, with implications for disease and health."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-29e111be732d4a638ce82bf75e2f45f7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRIMEMBRAÇÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"trimembração refers to the threefold structure of human beings, with distinct regions corresponding to neurossensorial, rítmico, and metabólico systems."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-29e111be732d4a638ce82bf75e2f45f7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;QUADRIMEMBRAÇÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Quadrimembração is the concept that humans have four essential structures or 'bodies': físico, vital, anímico, and organização do eu."&lt;SEP&gt;"quadrimembração refers to the fourfold structure of humanity, encompassing mineral, vegetal, animal, and spiritual realms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-29e111be732d4a638ce82bf75e2f45f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-873efdd7b0f41ae152e5c93ad592b9fb</data>
    </node>
