    <node id="&quot;RASTREAMENTO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"O rastreamento é uma ferramenta importante para a prevenção e o tratamento de doenças."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rastreamento is the process of screening and monitoring for cervical cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Screening is a concept that involves the use of tests to identify individuals at risk for cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rastreamento refers to the process of detecting and identifying health problems at an early stage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rastreamento refers to the process of early detection and monitoring of diseases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rastreamento refers to the process of identifying and tracking diseases, such as breast cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rastreamento refers to the process of tracking or monitoring health issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Screening is a method used to detect diseases such as breast cancer at an early stage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Screening is a process of detecting diseases at an early stage, before symptoms appear."&lt;SEP&gt;"Screening is the concept of testing for cancer in people who do not have symptoms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Screening or Rastreamento refers to the process of detecting diseases at an early stage through regular checks and tests."</data>
