    <node id="&quot;MAMA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A mama is a woman who breastfeeds her child, highlighting the importance of breastfeeding in mother-child bonding."&lt;SEP&gt;"A mama refers to a lactating woman who produces milk for her baby."&lt;SEP&gt;"A mama é uma figura importante na nutrição da criança."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mama is a person, likely a mother, who produces milk for her baby."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mama refers to the breastfeeding mother."&lt;SEP&gt;"mama is a colloquial term for the female breast."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference to a mother figure in healthcare discussions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Breast is a body part that can be affected by cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"breast is an organ associated with health guidelines and disease prevention."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-bb27b0d0f843229c4362efd22629b3e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35647ea59c96581e047ccab25a51421c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b61d7d46f12e426a8cc77b0137de8f8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5b7d98d57f5fe6e7fe2f8653ba91e3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e5ebe64151a8e84f5d0afb2d388a538&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba7f0a088f724c6ed0bc79bf9806da80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50061d3dc696c78c79ca8a7e90e3ad83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea28e07113a5700f957762296d96fe33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c17d8c1ca4e71680dd122eac85b3d508</data>
    </node>
