    <node id="&quot;ROBERTA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A healthcare worker who revises a patient's prontuário."&lt;SEP&gt;"Roberta is a healthcare professional who provides effective care to Lucimara's son Fernando and helps him recover from a serious health issue."&lt;SEP&gt;"Roberta is a healthcare provider who treated Lucimara and Fernando for their respective health issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Roberta is a healthcare worker who helps Elisandra and has expertise in managing patients' mental health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Roberta is a medical doctor working as a family medicine specialist, showing empathy and dedication to her patients."&lt;SEP&gt;"Roberta is a medical professional who shortens the interval between consultations for Fernando, intuiting that something is not right and he needs more support."&lt;SEP&gt;"Roberta is a professional who has had successes and satisfactions when she allowed herself to enter into contact with people in their complexity."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9797904778f869161cec7b5d0f0b637&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d380afd19f40dfa61d457f3dc6aadb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32124c7b9e2722470a9852457c93b0df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1c3b08fc1fbde211a80164e180f1e21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d06ae36faa37f6a3befaacf58e7dd091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1865e968e66096da006967d8a035447e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27d26a2834194cacb4566c35b4aa97e3</data>
