      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fernando is a patient of Roberta's, struggling with the use of crack."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fernando is a person experiencing agitation and aggression, for whom Roberta provides care."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fernando is a young man who is struggling with addiction and is being treated by Roberta."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fernando is a young man who uses crack and has various health problems, including fibromyalgia, hypertension, arthritis, and benzodiazepine dependence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fernando is a young man who was using crack, illustrating the challenges of addiction and social issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fernando is the son of Lucimara, for whom Roberta provides effective care and helps him recover from a serious health issue."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9797904778f869161cec7b5d0f0b637&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d380afd19f40dfa61d457f3dc6aadb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1c3b08fc1fbde211a80164e180f1e21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d06ae36faa37f6a3befaacf58e7dd091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1865e968e66096da006967d8a035447e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27d26a2834194cacb4566c35b4aa97e3</data>
