    <node id="&quot;CESSAÇÃO DO TABAGISMO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cessation of smoking is a process that leads to improved health outcomes and reduced risk of chronic diseases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cessation of smoking is the process of quitting smoking, which can be aided by medications like bupropiona."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cessação do Tabagismo is the process of quitting smoking and overcoming nicotine addiction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cessação do Tabagismo refers to the process of quitting smoking, which is a crucial component in preventing cardiovascular diseases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cessação do Tabagismo refers to the process or event of quitting smoking."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cessação do tabagismo is the process of quitting smoking, which can have numerous health benefits."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cessação do tabagismo refers to the act of quitting or stopping the habit of smoking tobacco, which is beneficial for both pregnant women and their children."&lt;SEP&gt;"cessação do tabagismo refers to the process of quitting smoking."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cessação do tabagismo refers to the process of quitting tobacco smoking."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9164b3575819d73e22cda57cef1652a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07bc1e08d2366b5013f7b32aedabcb11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b6a5a2fecc4a155135f5b8b3fac2712&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28201cd67044fec408951a80d38b6995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fc505c750c636f9bb74d49693535d6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e68f7c2a7af56f8cf13672a22068c5ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a80ec2ae2040bb8d2fa1b5438086575&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99646d1fb895cd19b10fbc49f8bd5be4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-140560412d3a2ae030b9c9eea365d86c</data>
