    <node id="&quot;FIORE ET AL.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A group of researchers"&lt;SEP&gt;"FIORE et al. are authors cited as references for smoking cessation treatment guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"FIORE et al. are authors who have written about the use of bupropiona for smoking cessation and its potential effects."&lt;SEP&gt;"FIORE et al. are researchers who have conducted studies on smoking cessation strategies and interventions."&lt;SEP&gt;"FIORE et al. are researchers who have contributed to the study of tobacco consumption and its effects on health."&lt;SEP&gt;"FIORE et al. are researchers who have contributed to the understanding of tobacco addiction and its treatment."&lt;SEP&gt;"FIORE et al. are researchers who have published a study on the effectiveness of bupropion for smoking cessation."&lt;SEP&gt;"FIORE et al. are researchers who have published studies related to smoking cessation."&lt;SEP&gt;"FIORE et al. are researchers who investigated the effectiveness of nicotine replacement therapy."&lt;SEP&gt;"FIORE et al. são pessoas que estudam a segurança da reposição de nicotina."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fiore et al. are researchers who conducted meta-analyses on smoking cessation and treatment effectiveness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fiore et al. is a group of authors who wrote about smoking cessation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fiore et al. is a research study or group mentioned in the text as having conducted research on smoking cessation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The authors of a study on smoking cessation."</data>
