    <node id="&quot;FUMAÇA DE DERIVADOS DO TABACO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Harmful substance emitted by tobacco products, associated with various health risks."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9a3c6cd16b2f7a9b55ab7a8dcb23be12</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TABAGISMO PASSIVO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fumaça inalada por um indivíduo que não está ativamente engajado em fumar, mas que é exposto à fumaça exalada por um fumante ativo."&lt;SEP&gt;"Inhalation of smoke from other people's cigarettes or similar sources."&lt;SEP&gt;"Passive smoking is the inhalation of smoke from burning tobacco products without actively smoking."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tabagismo passivo is the exposure to secondhand smoke, which can have negative effects on health even if you don't use tobacco products yourself."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5312b3cf8f059133dac84f8511dae72b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b4d617dec7d6d61a9092e052819cc2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd0c0aaf86855f73a8b8191234289801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a3c6cd16b2f7a9b55ab7a8dcb23be12</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NICOTINA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chemical substance causing physical dependence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nicotina is a chemical substance found in tobacco that can lead to physical dependence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nicotina is a substance found in cigarros that can stimulate the nervous system and promote aterosclerose."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nicotina is a substance found in tobacco products that can be addictive and difficult to quit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nicotina is the primary psychoactive substance in tobacco, associated with addiction and various health risks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nicotina refers to nicotine, a substance used in smoking cessation treatments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nicotina refers to the substance associated with smoking, which has an effect on the user."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nicotina é um agente viciante presente no tabaco, responsável pela dependência e possíveis efeitos colaterais."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nicotine is a substance present in tobacco and used as a medication for smoking cessation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nicotine refers to the substance found in tobacco that can cause addiction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to nicotine, a key component in the nicotine adhesive patches."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a97ac8340801618fd2a1000b9dfa38f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b8c30b6d53f21f4a7f9965008e68a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8b574b35a413f55547c5c38e7924ad1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db6ad97d8765b1f7c28dee9d2d190e0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07bc1e08d2366b5013f7b32aedabcb11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31d2ce1d3441a498e2a5f7d84d3feb53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56ab67e551dc5afb55f2ee1e66f3553c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1b1b8af6a199011d8cfa9555c9ddab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56b0d32b629110533e66a24bb88b5c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a80ec2ae2040bb8d2fa1b5438086575&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-482346e16dc04fbfa43b51715c7a551c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DROGAS DE DEPENDÊNCIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Drogas de Dependência refers to substances that can cause physical and psychological dependence."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-482346e16dc04fbfa43b51715c7a551c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CÉREBRO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cérebro refers to the brain, which is affected by nicotine and other substances."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-482346e16dc04fbfa43b51715c7a551c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DOPAMINA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dopamina is a neurotransmitter involved in pleasure, reward, and motivation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-482346e16dc04fbfa43b51715c7a551c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FUMAÇA DO CIGARRO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fumaça do cigarro refers to the smoke from cigarettes, which contains nicotine and other substances."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-482346e16dc04fbfa43b51715c7a551c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SINTOMAS DE ABSTINÊNCIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sintomas de Abstinência are the symptoms experienced during abstinence from a substance, such as nicotine."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sintomas de abstinência refers to the symptoms of withdrawal from smoking."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d7d3bbaaf47ab811340190d552779f8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-482346e16dc04fbfa43b51715c7a551c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOLERÂNCIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tolerância refers to the adaptation of the body to a substance, leading to increased tolerance and dependence."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-482346e16dc04fbfa43b51715c7a551c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SÍNDROME DE ABSTINÊNCIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A condition characterized by withdrawal symptoms after repeated use of a substance."&lt;SEP&gt;"A set of symptoms experienced by people who are trying to quit smoking."&lt;SEP&gt;"Síndrome de Abstinência refers to the symptoms experienced during abstinence from a substance, such as nicotine."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Síndrome de Abstinência is a concept that refers to the physical symptoms experienced by smokers when they try to quit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Variedade de sintomas desagradáveis que ocorrem após a redução ou suspensão do uso de determinada substância."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0b4d617dec7d6d61a9092e052819cc2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d70f3e640108e9be3763c8a64c2fd88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-508f56939cf6c2a2bbb43c8e2df002f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1111d27ad53b09f0edc26544dd62eb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-482346e16dc04fbfa43b51715c7a551c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEPENDÊNCIA FÍSICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Condition related to physical dependency on nicotine."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dependência Física refers to physical dependence on a substance, characterized by tolerance and abstinence syndrome."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-56b0d32b629110533e66a24bb88b5c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-482346e16dc04fbfa43b51715c7a551c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEPENDÊNCIA PSICOLÓGICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dependência Psicológica refers to psychological dependence on a substance, characterized by emotional attachment and compulsive behavior."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-482346e16dc04fbfa43b51715c7a551c</data>
    </node>
