      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Abordagem cognitivo-comportamental is a method that helps restructure dysfunctional thoughts and provide cognitive flexibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Abordagem cognitivo-comportamental is a therapeutic approach that focuses on identifying and changing negative thought patterns and behaviors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Abordagem cognitivo-comportamental is a therapeutic approach used to treat nicotine dependence."</data>
