    <node id="&quot;ACONSELHAMENTO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aconselhamento refers to the process of advising or counseling individuals on smoking cessation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aconselhamento refers to the process of providing guidance and support to individuals seeking to quit smoking or manage related health issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Counseling is a form of guidance for quitting smoking."&lt;SEP&gt;"O aconselhamento é uma abordagem que ajuda a mulher a tomar decisões e a desenvolver sua confiança no profissional de saúde."</data>
