    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CIGARRO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A type of tobacco product used for smoking."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cigarro is a type of tobacco product that is commonly smoked by individuals, often resulting in addiction and related health issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cigarro refers to cigarettes, which are the focus of the text's discussion on relapse prevention."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cigarro refers to the act of smoking."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cigarro refers to the habit of smoking, which perpetuates the cycle of addiction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cigarros are a type of tobacco product used by 90% of alcohol-dependent individuals, with 70% smoking at least one pack per day."&lt;SEP&gt;"Smoking device delivering nicotine."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2d70f3e640108e9be3763c8a64c2fd88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f0a26f64ebd25c62ea907c6c8a2a0b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a97ac8340801618fd2a1000b9dfa38f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b6a5a2fecc4a155135f5b8b3fac2712&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5d9da9fa35cfc8f2dd179cf423d6979&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56b0d32b629110533e66a24bb88b5c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae8c695990aff27d247569ec6c4fc98</data>
    </node>
