    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ORGANIZAÇÃO MUNDIAL DA SAÚDE (OMS)">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"OMS is an international organization that recommends best practices for childbirth and breastfeeding."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2400b83c4ab3efa72aa34b5e6d250251</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AVÓ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Avó (grandmother) has significant influence on young mothers, especially adolescents, and can either support or hinder breastfeeding practices."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2400b83c4ab3efa72aa34b5e6d250251</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FILHO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Filho (child) is the recipient of breastfeeding, and the topic focuses on providing a healthy environment for their growth."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2400b83c4ab3efa72aa34b5e6d250251</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEGISLAÇÃO DO BRASIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LEGISLATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Legislação do Brasil is the set of laws that protect and promote breastfeeding, considered one of the most advanced in the world."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2400b83c4ab3efa72aa34b5e6d250251</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MINISTRY OF HEALTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Ministry of Health is responsible for implementing policies and regulations related to breastfeeding protection."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-341106903ebd41cbf39d5264182bd504</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WOMEN'S RIGHTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Women's rights are protected in Brazil, including the right to breastfeed and receive maternity leave."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-341106903ebd41cbf39d5264182bd504</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRAZILIAN CONSTITUTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Brazilian Constitution ensures the protection of women's rights, including breastfeeding and maternity leave."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-341106903ebd41cbf39d5264182bd504</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DECREE Nº 6.690/2008&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"This decree extends the length of maternity leave for federal public servants to 180 days."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-341106903ebd41cbf39d5264182bd504</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEI FEDERAL Nº. 11.770/2008&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"This law creates the Programa Empresa Cidadã, which incentivizes private companies to offer extended maternity leave."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-341106903ebd41cbf39d5264182bd504</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROGRAMA EMPRESA CIDADÃ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Programa Empresa Cidadã is a program that incentivizes private companies to offer extended maternity leave."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-341106903ebd41cbf39d5264182bd504</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FEDERAL PUBLIC SERVANTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Federal public servants are entitled to 180 days of maternity leave according to the decree."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-341106903ebd41cbf39d5264182bd504</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRIVATE COMPANIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Private companies can participate in the Programa Empresa Cidadã to offer extended maternity leave."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-341106903ebd41cbf39d5264182bd504</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WOMEN'S RIGHTS ADVOCATES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Women's rights advocates work to protect and promote women's rights related to breastfeeding and maternity leave."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-341106903ebd41cbf39d5264182bd504</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERNATIONAL BABY FOOD ACTION NETWORK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"International Baby Food Action Network is a global network that works to protect breastfeeding and promote healthy infant nutrition."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1177947940cfb01dee281aa1fc5d9ca2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AMAMENTAÇÃO &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Amamentação refers to breastfeeding, a natural process of feeding infants with milk from their mothers."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1177947940cfb01dee281aa1fc5d9ca2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DESMAME &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Desmame refers to weaning, the process of stopping breastfeeding and transitioning to other sources of nutrition."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1177947940cfb01dee281aa1fc5d9ca2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAMADEIRA &quot;">
