    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GREVE DE AMAMENTAÇÃO &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONDITION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Greve de amamentação is a condition where a baby suddenly stops breastfeeding, often due to illness, teething, or overuse of pacifiers and bottles."</data>
