      <data key="d1">"A healthcare record book used to identify and track the needs of elderly individuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caderneta de Saúde da Pessoa Idosa is a health card used to track the healthcare needs and services provided to elderly individuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Caderneta de Saúde da Pessoa Idosa is a publication that helps identify elderly people who are frail or at risk of fragilization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Caderneta de Saúde da Pessoa Idosa is an instrument for identifying signs of frailty."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Senior Health Record Book is a tool used for identifying and recording symptoms and signs associated with aging."</data>
