    <node id="&quot;PESSOA IDOSA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A pessoa idosa is an older adult, who may experience various forms of abuse or mistreatment."&lt;SEP&gt;"A pessoa idosa refers to an elderly individual."&lt;SEP&gt;"A pessoa idosa é um indivíduo que sofre violência e necessita de atenção especial."&lt;SEP&gt;"An elderly person is a member of society who may be vulnerable to various forms of violence due to their age and dependence on others."&lt;SEP&gt;"An elderly person who may require assistance with daily activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Older adults are affected by various age-related conditions, including urinary incontinence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pessoa Idosa refers to an elderly person, being assessed for their cognitive function."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pessoa Idosa refers to an individual who has reached old age, requiring special attention and care."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Pessoa Idosa refers to older adults who are being cared for by healthcare teams."&lt;SEP&gt;"The elderly person who has passed away."&lt;SEP&gt;"The pessoa idosa is an individual who receives basic attention and is subject to various age-related changes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2e910fd747ed0d8db7ed44b19e490683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de199e955ca0907ebfe66e72edf13a0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8955a8c6e40ff0f40b0852b44e0e35b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b08e1c9b74d4e0c4b64d979c9046a9be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c2e8268c1155db3eb90790ad79e9567&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed7a24bca3e040d50fc3452d7f959660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdc17ca67c2048b961003b5a6920a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e214a761cbb1193242c87168fe80c31b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc88ee6dfa63a03b874da042bb4efdf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-400ce3dac690019f4a75de65ee8987a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8329b5264a11203795c34d3c6a9c942</data>
    </node>
