      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Quadro 2 highlights the various factors related to the dimensions of communication, essential for effective interaction between healthcare providers and older adults."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fc88ee6dfa63a03b874da042bb4efdf9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PERGUNTA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pergunta refers to the act of asking questions, crucial in healthcare settings for ensuring that patients understand their care and treatment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fc88ee6dfa63a03b874da042bb4efdf9</data>
    </node>
