    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INDEPENDÊNCIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Independence refers to the ability to perform daily activities without assistance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The ability to perform daily activities without assistance."</data>
