    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OSTEOPENIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Osteopenia is a condition characterized by low bone mass, which can increase the risk of fractures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Osteopenia refers to a condition where bones lose density, leading to increased risk of fractures."</data>
