    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RISCO A &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Risco A represents low cardiovascular risk for patients with no risk factors or lesions in organs."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb490afd1defb833be2449ce02b2d964</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RISCO B &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Risco B represents moderate cardiovascular risk for patients with some risk factors but no lesions in organs."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb490afd1defb833be2449ce02b2d964</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RISCO C &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Risco C represents high cardiovascular risk for patients with several risk factors and/or lesions in organs."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb490afd1defb833be2449ce02b2d964</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HIPERTENSÃO ARTERIAL MODERADA E ALTA &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONDITION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hipertensão Arterial moderada e alta refers to stages 2 and 3 of hypertension, requiring medication treatment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb490afd1defb833be2449ce02b2d964</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MUDANÇA DE ESTILO DE VIDA &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mudança de estilo de vida refers to changes in lifestyle that can help manage or prevent hypertension."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb490afd1defb833be2449ce02b2d964</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRATAMENTO MEDICAMENTOSO &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TREATMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tratamento Medicamentoso refers to the use of medication to treat hypertension."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb490afd1defb833be2449ce02b2d964</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DOENÇA RENAL CRÔNICA &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONDITION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Doença renal crônica is a chronic kidney disease that can increase cardiovascular risk."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb490afd1defb833be2449ce02b2d964</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIABETE MELITO &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONDITION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Diabete melito is a type of diabetes that can increase cardiovascular risk."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb490afd1defb833be2449ce02b2d964</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INGESTÃO DE BEBIDAS ALCOÓLICAS &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"HABIT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ingestão de bebidas alcoólicas refers to the consumption of alcoholic beverages, which can increase blood pressure."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb490afd1defb833be2449ce02b2d964</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRUTAS &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FOOD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Frutas are a type of fruit that can be part of a healthy diet and help manage hypertension."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb490afd1defb833be2449ce02b2d964</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VERDURAS &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FOOD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Verduras are a type of vegetable that can be part of a healthy diet and help manage hypertension."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb490afd1defb833be2449ce02b2d964</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DERIVADOS DE LEITE DESNATADO &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FOOD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Derivados de leite desnatado refers to dairy products without fat, which can be part of a healthy diet and help manage hypertension."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb490afd1defb833be2449ce02b2d964</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENALAPRIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Enalapril is another type of ACE inhibitor medication used to treat high blood pressure."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9906ecaf582c905c2f28fa4fd98541b4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ALEMAIA &quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Alemaia is a geographic location, specifically a country in Africa."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7ec6d63ef1395611f257dad68204fd85</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MINISTÉRIO DA SAUDE &quot;">
