    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEMÊNCIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dementia is a clinical syndrome caused by disease or cerebral dysfunction, characterized by progressive disturbance of multiple cognitive functions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dementia is a condition affecting older adults, requiring care and support from caregivers and healthcare providers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Demência is a cognitive disorder that can coexist with depression in its initial stages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Demência refers to a medical condition characterized by cognitive decline and memory loss."&lt;SEP&gt;"Demência refers to a syndrome of chronic and progressive disease or brain dysfunction, resulting in cognitive impairment, including memory, attention, learning, thought, orientation, understanding, calculation, language, and judgment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-30cba53594387889bd0cde4b9ae4bf18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c532157f4a308e14e573d17246a0c92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20b4d06c6548081ee298fc00ee33dae5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfde11ee1364c106d772b6f052893db3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b9f665713a38c80b41c6c29df0f752a</data>
    </node>
