      <data key="d3">79.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The CADERNOS DE ATENÇÃO BÁSICA publication is related to the Ministério da Saúde, which provides tools and information on basic care and health services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Cadernos de Atenção Básica are guidelines for primary care in Brazil, which is related to the Ministry of Health."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Cadernos de Atenção Básica are related to the Ministry of Health, indicating that they provide guidelines and strategies for basic healthcare within the organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health publishes Cadernos de Atenção Básica, a series of healthcare guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health publishes Cadernos de Atenção Básica, a series of publications on basic health care."&lt;SEP&gt;"The publication series Cadernos de Atenção Básica is published by the Ministry of Health, indicating its official support and endorsement."</data>
      <data key="d5">"guidelines, healthcare policy"&lt;SEP&gt;"guidelines, organizational policies"&lt;SEP&gt;"healthcare resources, community support"&lt;SEP&gt;"publication, government support"&lt;SEP&gt;"publication, health policy"&lt;SEP&gt;"publication, responsibility"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-8662c1bde799dfa0466be1e7bbc482fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aaadfce5744cf3ca8550487f628bbe6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d5920bb7af8aa253219a73b99d372ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fafb8b2529819deb56ac5f391b3309b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d7ae9031cba3be486096f40b70f5257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcc086fd1fd42c072828e9d7087e5319</data>
    </edge>
