      <data key="d3">104.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Brazilian public health system is part of the Ministry of Health." "&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health oversees the SUS healthcare system."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SUS is a public policy implemented by the Ministério da Saúde to guarantee access to healthcare for citizens."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SUS provides access to various medications including sulfonilureias and insulin, indicating the collaborative role between the SUS and the Ministry of Health in providing healthcare services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health oversees the SUS, which is a key component of their mission to provide universal access to healthcare."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health works within the framework of the Unified Health System."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SUS (Unified Health System) is an organization that works with the Ministério da Saúde to provide public health services in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SUS is an organization that works with the Ministério da Saúde to provide public health services in Brazil."</data>
