      <data key="d3">195.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BRASIL is the country where the Ministry of Health operates."&lt;SEP&gt;"BRASIL's Ministry of Health published several reports on healthcare attention and primary care, indicating their connection to the organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brazil has published guidelines for nutritional screening and diagnosis by the Ministry of Health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brazil has the Ministry of Health as a government institution responsible for its healthcare system."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health in Brazil is responsible for overseeing and implementing healthcare policies, which affects the country's health outcomes and statistics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brazil is the country where the Ministry of Health operates, implementing healthcare policies and programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health is the government agency responsible for implementing vaccination policies in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health operates within the government structure of Brazil, focusing on healthcare policies and services for its citizens."&lt;SEP&gt;"both entities promote and protect the health of children in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Ministry of Health promotes and protects the health of children in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brazil's Ministry of Health has been involved in efforts to control tobacco use and promote health initiatives." | &lt;relationship_keywords&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;"O Brasil é o país onde o Ministério da Saúde opera."&lt;SEP&gt;"The country of Brazil has laws and policies related to tobacco control, which are implemented by the Ministry of Health.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health is responsible for the health policies in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brazil has specific health priorities and policies implemented by the Ministry of Health, considering local realities and needs."</data>
