      <data key="d3">34.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A criança é a prioridade para o Ministério da Saúde no contexto do exame físico e desenvolvimento infantil."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health is responsible for ensuring the health and well-being of children in Brazil, which includes providing guidelines on child safety."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health provides policies and guidelines for the nutritional needs of children, including exclusive breastfeeding."</data>
      <data key="d5">"health policy, nutrition"&lt;SEP&gt;"healthcare, priority"&lt;SEP&gt;"responsibility, protection"</data>
