    <edge source="&quot;MINISTÉRIO DA SAÚDE &quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARIA DE ATENÇÃO À SAÚDE &quot;">
      <data key="d3">3186.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Ministério da Saúde and Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde are organizations that work together to promote public health policies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ministério da Saúde works with Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde to promote public health policies and provide basic care."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health and the Secretariat of Health Attention are related in their roles within the healthcare system."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health oversees the Department of Attention to Health, which focuses on healthcare service delivery."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health oversees the Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde, suggesting a hierarchical or functional relationship within the health ministry structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministério da Saúde oversees the Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde, which is responsible for attention to health.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministério da Saúde uses the guidelines provided by the Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde for health management in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health is responsible for health care policies, which includes the Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde's focus on basic health services.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministério da Saúde is an organization that includes the Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde as a department."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health has the Secretary of Attention to Health as a department within it.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health is responsible for health-related policies and regulations, which includes the Secretary of Attention to Health as a department within it.</data>
      <data key="d5">"bureaucratic structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"collaboration, public health"&lt;SEP&gt;"governance, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"health guidelines, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational hierarchy, health care services"&lt;SEP&gt;"oversight, health care"&lt;SEP&gt;"oversight, service delivery"&lt;SEP&gt;"policy-making, organizational structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"policy-making, service delivery"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-b3d63b984d7ef24a825f148c80f4b715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c96f1e21501a2da9d79b7b70d92e4864&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad2789a47bf6f9934e566d024a2f212a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1177947940cfb01dee281aa1fc5d9ca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3e59d2d587bdebedc6d62e5c3e7c854&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf92c8437f11bc80355451adcc8929b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e174b5b2da0116c7fb23edfd30b066b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8fbdcca6142a11665b95bb70d17aa20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67d6a8b9010cb1db66c419d9fc14a838</data>
