    <edge source="&quot;SECRETARIA DE ATENÇÃO À SAÚDE &quot;" target="&quot;DEPARTAMENTO DE ATENÇÃO BÁSICA &quot;">
      <data key="d3">2772.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Departamento de Atenção Básica and Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde are organizations that work together to provide basic care."&lt;SEP&gt;"Departamento de Atenção Básica works with Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde to provide basic care and promote public health policies."&lt;SEP&gt;"SOUZA and MACMILLAN's contributions are also relevant to the work of Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde and Departamento de Atenção Básica, suggesting applicability or relevance in their respective areas."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Departamento de Atenção Básica reports to the Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde, which is responsible for attention to health.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde and Departamento de Atenção Básica are related as they both deal with aspects of health care, possibly within the same organizational structure or sharing a goal."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Departamento de Atenção Básica works under the Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde to provide basic health care services.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Departamento de Atenção Básica is a department within the Secretaria de Atenção à Saúde."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Department of Basic Care works under the Secretariat of Attention to Health, indicating a hierarchical structure or organizational relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secretary of Attention to Health has the Department of Basic Attention as a department focused on basic health care.</data>
