    <edge source="&quot;DEPARTAMENTO DE ATENÇÃO BÁSICA&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARIA DE ATENÇÃO A SAÚDE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">112.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Departamento de Atenção Básica provides basic health services within the Secretariat of Attention to Health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Secretaria de Atenção a Saúde is responsible for Departamento de Atenção Básica, which provides primary health care services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Departamento de Atenção Básica is part of the Secretaria de Atenção a Saúde, indicating a functional relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secretary of Attention to Health is responsible for attention to health services, which are executed by the Department of Basic Attention."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Department of Attention to Health collaborates with the Basic Attention Department in providing healthcare services, showing their collaborative relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Department of Attention to Health has a department responsible for basic attention."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Department of Attention to Health is responsible for primary care and health attention, which may involve the Department of Basic Attention in providing basic healthcare services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Department of Healthcare Attention oversees the Basic Care Department and is responsible for healthcare services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secretariat of Attention to Health and the Department of Basic Attention work together in providing attention to health needs."</data>
