      <data key="d4">"Ministério da Saúde is responsible for Secretaria de Atenção a Saúde, which in turn is responsible for Departamento de Atenção Básica."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health is related to the Secretary of Health Attention, which is part of it."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health is responsible for promoting public health through the Department of Attention to Health."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secretaria de Atenção a Saúde is part of the Ministry da Saúde, indicating a hierarchical relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secretary of Health Care oversees health care policies and programs within the Ministry of Health, which impacts patients' experiences with healthcare services."&lt;SEP&gt;"They are part of the same ministry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ministério da Saúde oversees the Secretariat of Attention to Health, which is responsible for primary care services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health and the Secretariat for Health Attention are organizations that provide health-related information and services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health and the Secretary of Attention to Health are organizations that work together to improve healthcare."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health has a Secretariat for Attention to Health, which is responsible for basic healthcare services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health is responsible for health policies and guidelines, which are implemented by the Department of Attention to Health."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health is responsible for implementing policies and programs related to healthcare services, including check-ups for children."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health oversees the Department of Attention to Health, indicating their hierarchical relationship within the health system."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health oversees the Department of Health Attention, indicating a hierarchical relationship between these organizations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of Health oversees the Secretaria de Atenção a Saúde, which provides health care services and programs to the public."</data>
      <data key="d5">"collaboration, health services"&lt;SEP&gt;"government, healthcare"&lt;SEP&gt;"health care delivery, organizational structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"health services, government agencies"&lt;SEP&gt;"healthcare policy, child health"&lt;SEP&gt;"healthcare policy, departmental responsibilities"&lt;SEP&gt;"healthcare policy, patient impact"&lt;SEP&gt;"hierarchical structure, institutional relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"hierarchical structure, responsibility chain"&lt;SEP&gt;"hierarchy, organization"&lt;SEP&gt;"hierarchy, organizational structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"hierarchy, oversight"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational structure, responsibility"&lt;SEP&gt;"oversight, primary care"&lt;SEP&gt;"public health promotion, organizational structure"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-f40d73959502367ec1058f9c2efb4fbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41acceb866dee911466113db248ff66f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-363bc71d2a5aa7261ac4675c2714feb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6a57c58bb09415e02b9409595e54728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d497001181726b1bb9867b1ae9e20d1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1949f890dcf71789af5a2958cae81f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99fff7478bf2bd3b95b8c70cfcdf01e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70f2949c8b2394125303348585e7d9e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2be3e07a2e156aebd322421ddd280ab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbd52194582933b70baa0304d0591a2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9f02322094ac9d526bb0e64762f9904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8969359d91aa9bcbef176073fd9006cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ae29116b2fb71e6b393dd39416b4166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8728762326812a75c6257267058f1293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d06f87d2c657ca58fd7aba54b23b8d68</data>
