      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Vascular dementia's mechanisms lead to the intermediate phase, characterized by deterioration of cognitive functions, particularly memory deficits and involvement of other cognitive domains."</data>
      <data key="d5">"vascular mechanisms, cognitive impairment"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7c237c89e3d3730f160a6a8a3cf67ac7</data>
    </edge>
